			"Message": "build(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates with dependency bumps\n\nSynchronize Element submodule to 3682595a bringing coordinated changes across 8 components: Cocoon (@vitest/coverage-v8 v4.1.4→v4.1.5), Common (@cloudflare/workers-types update), Grove (wasmtime 42→44, wasmtime-wasi 42→44, wasmparser 0.245→0.247, prost 0.12→0.14, tonic 0.12→0.14, vergen 8→9), Output (remove compiled JS artifacts from Configuration), Rest (rayon 1.11.0→1.12.0), SideCar (tauri-plugin-shell 2.0→2.3), Sky (Astro 6.1.8→6.1.9, @astrojs/compiler-rs 0.1.7→0.1.8).\n\nAlso bump workspace Rust dependencies in Cargo.toml: tauri 2.10.2→2.10.3, tauri-plugin-dialog 2.6.0→2.7.0, tauri-plugin-fs 2.4.5→2.5.0, arboard 3.4→3.6, clap 4.5.60→4.6.1, config 0.15.19→0.15.22, env_logger 0.11.9→0.11.10, hickory-proto/server 0.25→0.26, once_cell 1.21.3→1.21.4, posthog-rs 0.3.5→0.5.3, prometheus 0.13.4→0.14.0, rand 0.10.0→0.10.1, sha2 0.10.9→0.11.0, sysinfo 0.38.2→0.38.4, tar 0.4.44→0.4.45, tauri-build 2.5.5→2.5.6, tempfile 3.26.0→3.27.0, tokio 1.49.0→1.52.1, tokio-tungstenite 0.28.0→0.29.0, toml 1.0.3→1.1.2, toml_edit 0.25.3→0.25.11, tracing-appender 0.2.4→0.2.5, tracing-subscriber 0.3.22→0.3.23, uuid 1.21.0→1.23.1, and OXC crates (0.48.0→0.127.0), zip 8.1.0→8.5.1.\n\nBump npm devDependencies in package.json: @biomejs/biome 2.4.10→2.4.12, @playform/pipe 0.1.4→0.1.5, @prettier/plugin-oxc 0.1.3→0.1.4, @vue/compiler-sfc 3.5.32→3.5.33, prettier 3.8.1→3.8.3, prettier-plugin-ember-template-tag 2.1.3→2.1.5, prettier-plugin-sh 0.18.0→0.18.1, typescript 6.0.2→6.0.3.\n\nThis coordinated update delivers dependency updates, build cleanup, and compatibility improvements across the monorepo while maintaining identical runtime behavior.",
