			"Message": "refactor(Project): Consolidate polyfill implementations into Output module\n\nSynchronize Element submodule to dccf43ce bringing a coordinated architectural refactor:\n- Output: Add Plugin module with CopyVSOutput, CopyVSRootFiles, SupplementFromDependency, CopyWorker, CopyNodeModules, StubUnpublishedAddons, CopyTauriMainProcessService copy plugins and StripCSSImport, InjectNameShim, ReplaceElectronIPCService, ReplaceSharedProcess, StaticToDynamicImport, ExtensionScannerIPC transform plugins\n- Sky: Update polyfill imports from @codeeditorland/wind/Target/Polyfills/* to @codeeditorland/output/Polyfill/*\n- Wind: Replace polyfill implementations with thin re-exports pointing to Output (ChildProcessPolyfill, FileProtocolShim, FileSystemPolyfill, IPCRendererShim, NativeModulePolyfill, ProcessPolyfill, SharedProcessProxy)\n\nThis eliminates duplicate code across the monorepo — polyfill fixes now only need to be made in Output to propagate to all consumers (Sky, Wind, Cocoon, and any future desktop shells).",
